    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A game about dinos digging up dinos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a paleontologist trying to revitalize a decrepit museum by filling it with beautiful fossils straight out the Cretaceous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">FEATURES:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- A cast of cute dinosaur (and other paleo) townsfolk</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Full character customization (species, color palette, etc.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Fossil cleaning mini game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Discover 14 fully-realized vertebrate fossils</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Drive across a curated open world and explore environments inspired by real-world dig sites</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Uncover the geological history of the region by collecting invertebrate fossils</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Find hidden content and easter eggs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Capsule artwork created by SunnyHallows</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A game about dinos digging up dinos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a paleontologist trying to revitalize a decrepit museum by filling it with beautiful fossils straight out the Cretaceous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">FEATURES:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- A cast of cute dinosaur (and other paleo) townsfolk</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Full character customization (species, color palette, etc.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Fossil cleaning mini game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Discover 14 fully-realized vertebrate fossils</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Drive across a curated open world and explore environments inspired by real-world dig sites</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Uncover the geological history of the region by collecting invertebrate fossils</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Find hidden content and easter eggs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Capsule artwork created by SunnyHallows</p>",
    "short_description": "A game about dinos digging up dinos. Become the paleontologist you always wanted to be: walk, hop, and drive around a badlands-inspired environment. Discover fossils and help restore a decrepit museum to its former glory.",
